      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="intro-b rv">
      <p class="first">An investment summit is more than a conference. It is where a region puts its economic case on the table, names the opportunities, and puts investors in the same room as the people who can act on them.</p>
      <p>The Jalna Investment Summit is designed to bring capital, enterprise, infrastructure, policy support and local capability onto one platform — creating focused conversations that can lead to site visits, partnerships and project proposals.</p>
      <p>Whether you are planning a new manufacturing facility, expanding an existing operation, building an export network, or scoping an emerging sector, the summit is built to help you decide whether Jalna belongs in your growth strategy.</p>
      <p>Jalna already has established seed, steel, engineering, plastics and agro-based industry. Its planned Multi-Modal Logistics Park is intended to support the region's dry-port, export, agricultural, steel, seed and cotton ecosystems.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

