      <li><i>04</i>Support partnerships between established businesses and new investors</li>
      <li><i>05</i>Explain relevant policies, incentives, land and infrastructure</li>
      <li><i>06</i>Encourage industrial expansion and technology adoption</li>
      <li><i>07</i>Strengthen Jalna's MSME and supplier ecosystem</li>
      <li><i>08</i>Promote export-oriented manufacturing</li>
      <li><i>09</i>Generate quality employment for local youth</li>
      <li><i>10</i>Facilitate Letters of Intent, partnerships and investment proposals</li>
