      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:20px">An indicative day<br>built for <em>dialogue</em>.</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:24px">The proposed programme moves from understanding Jalna's opportunity to focused sector discussions and investor conversations.</p>
