      <li><time>Session 01</time><h3 class="h3">Why invest in Jalna?</h3><p>Infrastructure, industrial strengths, connectivity, land, workforce and opportunity.</p></li>
      <li><time>Session 02</time><h3 class="h3">Sector opportunity sessions</h3><p>Seeds, steel, agro-processing, logistics, engineering and emerging industries.</p></li>
      <li class="brk"><time>Interval</time><h3 class="h3">Networking lunch</h3></li>
      <li><time>Session 03</time><h3 class="h3">Policy, incentives and investor facilitation</h3><p>What support exists, who administers it, and how to access it.</p></li>
      <li><time>Meetings</time><h3 class="h3">B2B and B2G discussions</h3><p>Focused conversations across industry, government and finance.</p></li>
      <li><time>Showcase</time><h3 class="h3">Partnership and investment proposals</h3></li>
      <li><time>Closing</time><h3 class="h3">Building Jalna's future together</h3></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

