      <p class="lede">The purpose is not simply to attract capital. It is to build an ecosystem where investment strengthens industry, enables innovation, expands exports, supports entrepreneurs and creates real employment. When businesses grow in Jalna, the gain should reach its industries, farmers, workers, young people and communities.</p>
      <blockquote class="quote">Invest in enterprise. Invest in employment. Invest in Jalna.<cite>Jalna Investment Summit</cite></blockquote>
